   - release_operator_resource destination_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha

Now after these, we have origin and destination availability locked, confirmed, nodes ready, cargo available.

3. Assemble transport leg:
   - assemble_transport_leg origin_availability_alpha destination_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha destination_node_alpha transport_leg_alpha
   (requires origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, origin_node_ready, destination_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_available)
