   (requires transport_leg_assembled, origin_availability_locked, candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha, not transport_leg_loading_authorized)
   Effects: transport_leg_loading_authorized.

Now we have transport leg assembled and loading authorized.

Now we can mark origin and destination dispatch ready:

5. mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready origin_availability_alpha transport_leg_alpha
   (requires origin_availability_locked, origin_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_loading_authorized, not dispatch_ready origin_availability_alpha)
